 "subtitles": [
  {
   "shot": "s01_dawn_city",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 6.991,
   "lines": [
    "Before the city wakes, before the",
    "darkness lifts, one light turns on first"
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s01_dawn_city",
   "start": 6.991,
   "end": 8.06,
   "lines": [
    "in our home."
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s02_fanning_embers",
   "start": 8.733,
   "end": 15.377,
   "lines": [
    "It is Emama. Fanning the embers, she",
    "welcomes the day with prayer and the"
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s02_fanning_embers",
   "start": 15.377,
   "end": 16.833,
   "lines": [
    "scent of coffee."
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s03_roasting_beans",
   "start": 17.9,
   "end": 24.718,
   "lines": [
    "As the green beans roast on the iron",
    "pan, the silence of the house fills with"
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s03_roasting_beans",
   "start": 24.718,
   "end": 25.78,
   "lines": [
    "sweet aroma."
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s04_wafting_smoke",
   "start": 27.067,
   "end": 33.252,
   "lines": [
    "Drawing the smoke toward her, she",
    "whispers “Thank God”—for the new day,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s04_wafting_smoke",
   "start": 33.252,
   "end": 35.517,
   "lines": [
    "for her children's health."
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s05_mortar",
   "start": 36.233,
   "end": 42.94,
   "lines": [
    "The rhythm of the mortar is our home's",
    "morning clock—the melody of love ground"
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s05_mortar",
   "start": 42.94,
   "end": 44.143,
   "lines": [
    "with patience."
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s06_jebena_on_fire",
   "start": 45.4,
   "end": 50.686,
   "lines": [
    "As the jebena settles onto the fire, the",
    "morning sun slips quietly through the"
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s06_jebena_on_fire",
   "start": 50.686,
   "end": 51.16,
   "lines": [
    "window."
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s07_first_abol",
   "start": 53.733,
   "end": 61.521,
   "lines": [
    "When the first Abol is poured, the cups",
    "fill—one for the house, the rest for her"
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s07_first_abol",
   "start": 61.521,
   "end": 63.273,
   "lines": [
    "children far away."
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s08_cup_and_photo",
   "start": 64.567,
   "end": 70.386,
   "lines": [
    "Though distance separates us, inside",
    "this single cup of coffee, a mother's"
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s08_cup_and_photo",
   "start": 70.386,
   "end": 72.117,
   "lines": [
    "love always unites us."
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": "s09_emama_smile",
   "start": 72.9,
   "end": 78.49,
   "lines": [
    "Coffee can be warmed again when it",
    "cools; a mother's love never grows cold."
   ]
